abstract: >-
  R code for the statistical analyses, multivariate analyses (PCA, PERMANOVA)
  and the nested spatial block cross-validated comparison of Random Forest,
  GAM and LMM used to model and map carbon pools (SOC, AGC, BGC, deadwood,
  litter, total C) in three Malagasy open-ecosystem sites, with bootstrap
  uncertainty maps.
keywords:
  - carbon stock mapping
  - soil organic carbon
  - open ecosystems
  - spatial cross-validation
  - random forest
  - Madagascar
